{"4398190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INK MAZE", "steam_appid": 4398190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INK MAZE is a short, turn-based metroidvania with a strong focus on unique puzzles about exploring and charting treasure maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHART YOUR PATH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own mapping language consisting of cryptic symbols so you can safely explore the fog.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your creativity to solve unique communication problems with your future self. It might be a while before you explore that room you've just charted.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the maze in a non-linear fashion. You might chart a room that gives you a sneak peek at areas and loot you've yet to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/e9e66c9ead72665e0ecdca8abdc44437.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/e9e66c9ead72665e0ecdca8abdc44437.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/e9e66c9ead72665e0ecdca8abdc44437.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND IMPROVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher your mapping language as you explore rooms filled with traps, puzzles, loot, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hidden knowledge to outsmart the dungeon and bypass its locks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find power-ups that recontextualize the way you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/af71512ee0f618dfc2009de90a99eff0.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/af71512ee0f618dfc2009de90a99eff0.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/af71512ee0f618dfc2009de90a99eff0.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET QUIRKY ADVENTURERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with a small but unique cast of characters also looking to put an end to the mist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete charming quests that breathe life into the world of INK MAZE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how each character uses the charting mechanic in their own silly way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/742b867d8e75cc7032fd357fc8827821.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/742b867d8e75cc7032fd357fc8827821.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/742b867d8e75cc7032fd357fc8827821.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS IT NOT?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no <i>combat</i>. This game is about outsmarting danger instead of facing it head-on using weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a <i>long</i> game. This game is a short but dense, puzzle-focused metroidvania about the unique prospect of map-making.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/cf43a4530a68ea0957751095420489b0.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/cf43a4530a68ea0957751095420489b0.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/cf43a4530a68ea0957751095420489b0.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO IS THAT?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is Oolix. Say hi, Oolix!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/f138d5debb7bf5041fe1e0fad0dee355.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/f138d5debb7bf5041fe1e0fad0dee355.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/f138d5debb7bf5041fe1e0fad0dee355.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INK MAZE is a short, turn-based metroidvania with a strong focus on unique puzzles about exploring and charting treasure maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHART YOUR PATH</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own mapping language consisting of cryptic symbols so you can safely explore the fog.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your creativity to solve unique communication problems with your future self. It might be a while before you explore that room you've just charted.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe the maze in a non-linear fashion. You might chart a room that gives you a sneak peek at areas and loot you've yet to discover.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/e9e66c9ead72665e0ecdca8abdc44437.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/e9e66c9ead72665e0ecdca8abdc44437.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/e9e66c9ead72665e0ecdca8abdc44437.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AND IMPROVE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher your mapping language as you explore rooms filled with traps, puzzles, loot, and secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hidden knowledge to outsmart the dungeon and bypass its locks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find power-ups that recontextualize the way you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/af71512ee0f618dfc2009de90a99eff0.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/af71512ee0f618dfc2009de90a99eff0.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/af71512ee0f618dfc2009de90a99eff0.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEET QUIRKY ADVENTURERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with a small but unique cast of characters also looking to put an end to the mist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete charming quests that breathe life into the world of INK MAZE.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience how each character uses the charting mechanic in their own silly way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/742b867d8e75cc7032fd357fc8827821.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/742b867d8e75cc7032fd357fc8827821.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/742b867d8e75cc7032fd357fc8827821.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS IT NOT?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no <i>combat</i>. This game is about outsmarting danger instead of facing it head-on using weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a <i>long</i> game. This game is a short but dense, puzzle-focused metroidvania about the unique prospect of map-making.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/cf43a4530a68ea0957751095420489b0.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/cf43a4530a68ea0957751095420489b0.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/cf43a4530a68ea0957751095420489b0.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO IS THAT?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That is Oolix. Say hi, Oolix!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/f138d5debb7bf5041fe1e0fad0dee355.poster.avif?t=1779729697\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/f138d5debb7bf5041fe1e0fad0dee355.webm?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4398190/extras/f138d5debb7bf5041fe1e0fad0dee355.mp4?t=1779729697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Chart your own path through a fog-shrouded dungeon in INK MAZE! Design cryptic treasure maps to solve puzzles, outsmart traps, and collect loot hidden within the mist. But when you reach the depths of the maze, will you still be able to decipher the symbols you charted long ago?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/439